                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.6363/204: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Jay</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-08-07T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                                1924—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>38. Your 54, August 5, 9 p.m. received. Department fully approves arrangements
                    indicated and desires you to confirm departure by telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
